                <pb facs="0256" n="160" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg160"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Consul-general at Shanghai
                        to Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-08-15"><hi rendition="#italic">August 15,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Conger wires reaching Tsinan-fu to-day. Still imprisoned and violently attacked
                    by Chinese army. Dr. Inglis’s baby and 7 marines dead. All other Americans
                    alive. Considerable sickness. Allies within 40 miles; gives us strong hope.
                    Woodwards, Chicago, well.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Goodnow.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
